1
00:00:01,616 --> 00:00:03,215
(Q11&12（多选）) Hello everyone.

2
00:00:03,215 --> 00:00:10,509
My name's Megan Baker and I'm a recruitment consultant at AVT Recruitment specialists.

3
00:00:10,509 --> 00:00:23,576
Now, our company specialises in positions that involve working in the agriculture and horticulture sectors, so that's fresh food production, garden and park maintenance and so on.

4
00:00:23,576 --> 00:00:28,533
And these sectors do provide some very special career opportunities.

5
00:00:28,533 --> 00:00:43,979
[Q11&12答案句C： flexible 工作机会] For a start, they often offer opportunities for those who don't want to be stuck with a 40-hour week, but need to juggle work with other responsibilities such as child care – and this is very important for many of our recruits.

6
00:00:43,979 --> 00:00:54,297
[Q11&12干扰项E： 排除， cannot guarantee] Some people like working in a rural setting, surrounded by plants and trees instead of buildings, although we can't guarantee that.

7
00:00:54,297 --> 00:01:03,897
[Q11&12答案句A： healthy lifestyle = active] But there are certainly health benefits, especially in jobs where you're not sitting all day looking at a screen, a big plus for many people.

8
00:01:03,897 --> 00:01:09,480
[Q11&12干扰项B： 高于平均薪资：排除：although ... variety] Salaries can sometimes be good too, although there's a lot of variety here.

9
00:01:09,480 --> 00:01:21,035
[Q11&12干扰项D： 出国工作机会，排除：depend on job] And you may have the opportunity in some types of jobs for travel overseas, although that obviously depends on the job, and not everyone is keen to do it.

10
00:01:21,035 --> 00:01:25,743
(Q13&14) Of course, working outdoors does have its challenges.

11
00:01:25,743 --> 00:01:31,555
[Q13&14答案句C： difficult weather conditions] It's fine in summer, but can be extremely unpleasant when it's cold and windy.

12
00:01:31,555 --> 00:01:39,880
[Q13&14干扰项E： physical fitness：排除：that's not as important] You may need to be pretty fit for some jobs, though with modern technology that's not as important as it once was.

13
00:01:39,880 --> 00:01:48,048
[Q13&14干扰项A： increasing risk，排除： fewer work accident] And standards of health and safety are much higher now than they used to be, so there are fewer work-related accidents.

14
00:01:48,048 --> 00:01:59,353
[Q13&14答案句B： remote = quiet] But if you like a lively city environment surrounded by lots of people, these jobs are probably not for you – they're often in pretty remote areas.

15
00:01:59,353 --> 00:02:10,182
[Q13&14干扰项D： cost of housing,首先cost没提及， 其次， 就算提到了housing， 最后都turns out fine] And some people worry about finding a suitable place to live, but in our experience, this usually turns out fine.

16
00:02:10,182 --> 00:02:17,623
(Q15（Matching）) Now let me tell you about some of the exciting jobs that we have on our books right now.

17
00:02:17,623 --> 00:02:21,499
One is for a fresh food commercial manager.

18
00:02:21,499 --> 00:02:28,559
Our client here is a very large fresh food producer supplying a range of top supermarkets.

19
00:02:28,559 --> 00:02:42,222
[Q17答案句D： intensive work but also fun, past-paced = intensive,play hard = fun] They operate in a very fast-paced environment with low profit margins – the staff there work hard, but they play hard as well, so if you've a sociable personality this may be for you.

20
00:02:42,222 --> 00:02:56,351
(Q16) We have an exciting post as an agronomist advising farmers on issues such as crop nutrition, protection against pests, and the latest legislation on farming and agricultural practices.

21
00:02:56,351 --> 00:03:08,616
[Q16答案句F： chance for rapid promotion, 晋升的表达] There are good opportunities for the right person to quickly make their way up the career ladder, but a deep knowledge of the agricultural sector is expected of applicants.

22
00:03:08,616 --> 00:03:17,543
(Q17) [Q17答案句A： 12-month contract = not permanent 非永久的工作] A leading supermarket is looking for a fresh produce buyer who is available for a 12-month maternity cover contract.

23
00:03:17,543 --> 00:03:29,860
[Q17干扰项：可能选成E， 因为 competitive salary 会误导成 earn more] You need to have experience in administration, planning and buying in the fresh produce industry, and in return will receive a very competitive salary.

24
00:03:29,860 --> 00:03:36,089
(Q18) We have also received a request for a sales manager for a chain of garden centres.

25
00:03:36,089 --> 00:03:43,310
[Q18答案句： you'll be visiting xxx = local travel involved] You will be visiting centres in the region to ensure their high levels of customer service are maintained.

26
00:03:43,310 --> 00:03:49,215
[Q 18干扰项G？ live there 就想选accommodation 不对] This post is only suitable for someone who is prepared to live in the region.

27
00:03:49,215 --> 00:03:57,274
(Q19) There is also a vacancy for a tree technician to carry out tree cutting, forestry and conservation work.

28
00:03:57,274 --> 00:04:04,360
Candidates must have a clean driving licence and have training in safety procedures.

29
00:04:04,360 --> 00:04:14,068
[Q19答案句C： 一年经验优先， but company 也 might consider刚结束training的人， 所以➡️experience not essential] A year's experience would be preferred but the company might be prepared to consider someone who has just completed an appropriate training course.

30
00:04:14,068 --> 00:04:18,413
(Q20) Finally, we have a position for a farm worker.

31
00:04:18,413 --> 00:04:28,245
This will involve a wide range of farm duties including crop sowing and harvesting, machine maintenance and animal care.

32
00:04:28,245 --> 00:04:37,345
[Q20答案句G： possibility to rent cottage = accommodation 上下义替换。      至于为啥不是E earn more : through Overtime加班， 没提及加班的事] Perks of the job include the possibility of renting a small cottage on the estate, and the chance to earn a competitive salary.

33
00:04:37,345 --> 00:04:39,845
[Q20可能干扰项H： 听到需要driver license，就觉得需要 local travel，其实需要的是tractor 拖拉机， 而且这俩也没啥关系] A driving licence and tractor driving experience are essential.

